{
  "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
  "$id": "https://frontend-lib.dev/ai/tokens.schema.json",
  "title": "frontend-lib 令牌契约",
  "$comment": [
    "描述 ai/tokens.json 的形状，由 05-audit/gen-ai-contract.py 生成。",
    "",
    "🔴 为什么用 $value / $type 这种写法：",
    "   这是 W3C Design Tokens 草案的形状，Open Props 与 Primer 都在用。",
    "   好处是 Figma / Style Dictionary / 各类构建工具能**直接消费**，",
    "   不需要我们再写一层的适配。对标的意义就在这里 —— 不是更好看，是更少重复。",
    "",
    "🔴 真值方向：tokens.css 是真值，本文件是导出物，",
    "   一致性由 gen-ai-contract.py --check 保证（单向，不双向同步）。"
  ],
  "type": "object",
  "required": ["schemaVersion", "source", "sets"],
  "properties": {
    "schemaVersion": { "type": "string" },
    "source": { "type": "string" },
    "sets": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "light": { "$ref": "#/definitions/tokenSet" },
        "dark": { "$ref": "#/definitions/tokenSet" }
      },
      "required": ["light", "dark"]
    },
    "coverage": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "lightCount": { "type": "number" },
        "darkCount": { "type": "number" },
        "onlyInDark": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } },
        "onlyInLight": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } }
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "tokenSet": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": { "$ref": "#/definitions/token" }
    },
    "token": {
      "type": "object",
      "required": ["$value"],
      "properties": {
        "$value": { "type": "string" },
        "$type": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["color", "dimension", "number", "duration",
                   "cubicBezier", "alias", "other"]
        },
        "$description": { "type": "string" }
      }
    }
  }
}
